   "does": "Snapshots current, dailySeries, fingerprint ('' if nil), computedDay, savedAt (= computedAt) and loadSettings, then in a detached utility task that first awaits the previous write (persistTask), JSON-encodes and atomically writes it to TrainingMetricsCache.json, so snapshots land in the order they were taken; errors are logged as warnings. Nothing is written before the first compute (computedAt nil).",
   "entry": null,
   "calls": [
